      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u201CI knew Mr.      for a long time; I'm his secretary. I\u2019m in
    shock, he wasn\u2019t only my boss, he was like a father figure to me.      taught
    me everything I know. I can't believe someone would do that to him. I'm sure
    there\u2019s something up with this woman named Dalia. I saw her once or twice
    following Mr.          to his office, and I noticed that she was following him
    on his business trip as well. She was asking me about him and writing a suspicious
    amount of notes about him in her journal.\u201D"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
