  m_text: "This letter was found in a private file and appears to be written by someone
    named Mona to her brother. It discusses a family matter involving their mother\u2019s
    health and mentions someone planning a business trip from Damascus to Madina.\nThe
    writer hints at an opportunity to act on something related to their father and
    refers to a plan that the brother may be involved in. The exact nature of the
    plan is unclear.\n"
